26:44.700 --> 26:47.500
But there's nothing surprising about this at all.

26:47.500 --> 26:49.400
Because actually, you know, carnation

26:49.400 --> 26:51.600
has the consistency of cream.

26:51.600 --> 26:53.300
Really, it's heavy enough to whip.

26:53.300 --> 26:56.400
And there is good, rich cream in every single drop.

26:56.400 --> 26:58.300
You know, millions of people like carnation better

26:58.300 --> 27:00.000
than cream in their coffee.

27:00.000 --> 27:02.000
And I'm sure that you too, when you try carnation

27:02.000 --> 27:04.200
in your coffee, will agree that it gives your coffee

27:04.200 --> 27:07.300
an added richness and flavor, a delightful smoothness

27:07.300 --> 27:09.800
that ordinary cream just doesn't give you.

27:09.800 --> 27:12.000
And when you stop to think that carnation actually costs

27:12.000 --> 27:14.800
less than half as much as cream, then you'll

27:14.800 --> 27:17.600
know why it pays in every way to cream your coffee

27:17.600 --> 27:18.900
with carnation.

27:18.900 --> 27:21.000
The milk that whips.

